		measure 'Estoque Carvão RRP' = ```
				VAR _u =
				    CALCULATE (
				        MAX ( f_Estoque_VS[DATA] ),
				        KEEPFILTERS (
				            FILTER (
				                f_Estoque_VS,
				                NOT ISBLANK ( f_Estoque_VS[ESTOQUE - VS CMG] ) || f_Estoque_VS[ESTOQUE - VS RRP - TOTAL] <> 0
				            )
				        )
				    )
				RETURN
				    CALCULATE ( SUM ( f_Estoque_VS[ESTOQUE - VS RRP - TOTAL] ), REMOVEFILTERS ( d_Calendario ), f_Estoque_VS[DATA] = _u )
				```
